<title>USA: Chevy Chase Bank FSB sells $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Chevy Chase Bank FSB sells $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Chevy Chase Bank FSB was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER: CHEVY CHASE BANK FSB</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 9.25 PCT   MATURITY 12/1/08</p>
<p>TYPE SUB DEBS	ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 6/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 9.25 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 314 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALLALBE FOR</p>
<p>							    FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
